{"id":"cc6b2cfbdcc658df","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-bimodal-kripke-semantics.md","title":"Bimodal Kripke Semantics","display":"df-bimodal-kripke-semantics — Bimodal Kripke Semantics","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-bimodal-kripke-semantics","aliases":["89-df-bimodal-kripke-semantics"],"display":"df-bimodal-kripke-semantics — Bimodal Kripke Semantics","depends_on":["[[89-df-bimodal-formula]]"],"created":"2026-10-09","revised":"2026-10-09"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-bimodal-kripke-semantics"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-bimodal-kripke-semantics</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-bimodal-kripke-semantics — Bimodal Kripke Semantics"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a6d483dd2c6fd176\" href=\"?note=a6d483dd2c6fd176\" title=\"89-df-bimodal-formula\">89-df-bimodal-formula</a></span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-09"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-09"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F=(W,R_0,R_1)\">\\(F=(W,R_0,R_1)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\\ne\\varnothing\">\\(W\\ne\\varnothing\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R_0,R_1\\subseteq (W\\times W)\">\\(R_0,R_1\\subseteq (W\\times W)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V:\\mathrm{Prop}\\to\\mathcal P(W)\">\\(V:\\mathrm{Prop}\\to\\mathcal P(W)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(W,R_0,R_1,V)\">\\(M=(W,R_0,R_1,V)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in W\">\\(w\\in W\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in\\{0,1\\}\">\\(i\\in\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>；下面的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models\">\\(\\models\\)</span> 以其双模态参数类型区分于单模态语义。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bimodal\\text{-}kripke\\text{-}semantics}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nM,w\\models p&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow w\\in V(p),\\quad M,w\\not\\models\\bot,\\\\\nM,w\\models\\neg A&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\neg(M,w\\models A),\\\\\nM,w\\models A\\land B&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow(M,w\\models A)\\land(M,w\\models B),\\\\\nM,w\\models\\Box_iA&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall v\\in W\\ (wR_iv\\to M,v\\models A),\\\\\nF\\models A&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall V:\\mathrm{Prop}\\to\\mathcal P(W)\\ \\forall w\\in W\\ (W,R_0,R_1,V),w\\models A,\\\\\nF\\models L&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall A\\in L\\ F\\models A\\quad(L\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bimodal\\text{-}kripke\\text{-}semantics}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nM,w\\models p&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow w\\in V(p),\\quad M,w\\not\\models\\bot,\\\\\nM,w\\models\\neg A&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\neg(M,w\\models A),\\\\\nM,w\\models A\\land B&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow(M,w\\models A)\\land(M,w\\models B),\\\\\nM,w\\models\\Box_iA&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall v\\in W\\ (wR_iv\\to M,v\\models A),\\\\\nF\\models A&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall V:\\mathrm{Prop}\\to\\mathcal P(W)\\ \\forall w\\in W\\ (W,R_0,R_1,V),w\\models A,\\\\\nF\\models L&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall A\\in L\\ F\\models A\\quad(L\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本条补齐本书实际使用但原压缩包未提供的基础接口；不恢复或冒充其他书籍的原文件。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-bimodal-formula","status":"resolved","id":"a6d483dd2c6fd176","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-bimodal-formula]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"F=(W,R_0,R_1)","display":false},{"tex":"W\\ne\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"R_0,R_1\\subseteq (W\\times W)","display":false},{"tex":"V:\\mathrm{Prop}\\to\\mathcal P(W)","display":false},{"tex":"M=(W,R_0,R_1,V)","display":false},{"tex":"w\\in W","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}","display":false},{"tex":"i\\in\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\models","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bimodal\\text{-}kripke\\text{-}semantics}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nM,w\\models p&\\Longleftrightarrow w\\in V(p),\\quad M,w\\not\\models\\bot,\\\\\nM,w\\models\\neg A&\\Longleftrightarrow\\neg(M,w\\models A),\\\\\nM,w\\models A\\land B&\\Longleftrightarrow(M,w\\models A)\\land(M,w\\models B),\\\\\nM,w\\models\\Box_iA&\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall v\\in W\\ (wR_iv\\to M,v\\models A),\\\\\nF\\models A&\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall V:\\mathrm{Prop}\\to\\mathcal P(W)\\ \\forall w\\in W\\ (W,R_0,R_1,V),w\\models A,\\\\\nF\\models L&\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall A\\in L\\ F\\models A\\quad(L\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1388,"backlinks":[{"id":"5121b107e6141953","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"05a599f85e508061","anchor":"ref-141","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-bimodal-kripke-semantics]]"},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-35","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[89-df-bimodal-kripke-semantics]]"}],"outgoing":["a6d483dd2c6fd176"]}